      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T09:39:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s my understanding as well. I actually think only one of them may be used at a time (from reading a few seapp_contexts). \n\nThe plan is to follow up with another change which will remove these, and only keep the string of the \"is\" selector (see wip on the change chain).",
